1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:03,698
Rae! Someone lost
a whole planet!

2
00:00:03,738 --> 00:00:05,835
That's where the socks go.

3
00:00:07,205 --> 00:00:09,866
And... somebody's Tuesday?

4
00:00:09,906 --> 00:00:12,082
That explains last week.

5
00:00:14,308 --> 00:00:19,137
Hi. Did anyone turn in a Tuesday?
I've had three Mondays.

6
00:00:19,177 --> 00:00:20,935
We found it!

7
00:00:23,205 --> 00:00:27,209
Welcome back!
Your storage fee is one Wednesday.

8
00:00:28,529 --> 00:00:30,783
That's where Wednesdays go.

9
00:00:31,153 --> 00:00:34,034
It's Thursday?!
I'm late!

10
00:00:34,354 --> 00:00:36,608
Sir! Your briefcase!

11
00:00:38,528 --> 00:00:42,062
Rae! Our planet
has a moon!
